    {
      "id": "243c6cf3-c3b4-4a4d-b757-fba46014c136",
      "title": "Compare os exemplos e repare no trecho que continua igual em todos eles.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "367416c4-03ee-4c6c-b3ef-cb64d5d38511",
          "textContent": "<p>O pedaço fixo mais importante é <strong>vivo en</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Vivo en Lima.</strong></li><li><strong>Vivo en Santiago.</strong></li><li><strong>Vivo en Ciudad de México.</strong></li></ul><p>Depois de <strong>en</strong>, você troca só o lugar.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "67898db5-e57a-410e-ae9c-4a414676fa4a",
      "title": "Leia os pares e observe que cada resposta corresponde a uma pergunta diferente.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e55e3d5e-39ca-4f73-9936-cf03f6c176fe",
          "textContent": "<p>Estas duas respostas não dizem a mesma coisa.</p><ul><li><strong>¿De dónde eres?</strong> → <strong>Soy de Perú.</strong></li><li><strong>¿Dónde vives?</strong> → <strong>Vivo en Bogotá.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Soy de...</strong> fala da origem. <strong>Vivo en...</strong> fala do lugar onde a pessoa mora agora.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c1639933-11c9-49d8-ac66-9a6a90b26cbc",
      "title": "Conversa curta entre colegas",
      "description": "<p>Dois colegas se conhecem e falam rapidamente de onde moram.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Hola. ¿Dónde vives?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Oi. Onde você mora?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/33b6c8279473497ca454610f106c96fc_b07-dialogo-hola-donde-vives.mp3?Expires=1794099400&Signature=Tcqr0G~NfolHI2IRzQlJCIrTjpHjg7q~Ui7rdMekAtoickpg4PMu73m8W-mgiDMm9wehAoZOMaSRD2-VT6~qFnhoGLBNW5flhdg8J3rw~jIONPlMDamk5b9Jbia4Ki1S5D76u5VpItAegiB33KO-32ep0ooSIEeOmDp30g~mcKpFQ1ITqBBs~JyMcJday4j9LuBHwYDAhoI5G29XnDuOfx89SNhMP6YzZaPNIn7ojigoWK73hJvPmtlj8ooLLelIJ-0BsPouVqJOr7zT~kGjKBbgY5pJ1PckeQNqyTJSBTrSsp5w7dpR6JQ6yTQdy7dHwQS7zDsG1ROMvHA9g72bPA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Vivo en Bogotá. ¿Y tú?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Moro em Bogotá. E você?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/22b11b3115a14566acd8e4e5087fb0f6_b07-dialogo-vivo-en-bogota-y-tu.mp3?Expires=1794099400&Signature=kzV8Q5hj-TREmzCHcwb6lzQisBDvwRcAAyAaFf8kLXwRGtdUVOrQvxuQAXs~QHuT4nTi2h2ouinGLgWhCiCmX1OmWPKQpCfrr8QDX5g2W1vuNbewZCXkingzeBth-emDGrITzg9P5j5MhxJmBVQI4jhmgJXboVrvVlez470jf0~Fdy8GCM7uD-pbxoWyCG6CBVmYFbxxBFlEjXqGtE3swoGKAYC1CvBd68ydj2y8ymXxRdJHTZy4FTR6cYdjUGi7h88Yu9R859RfMPTLjlHU1P0WvbC9Wb~wJPgxRiZfBO~4st2-qLYiJSHV~v1qsG4Dk8WygtwqGzpj8~XBRh1bkQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Vivo en Medellín.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Moro em Medellín.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2e53ff3a532644d595a70d4cee67b74f_b07-dialogo-vivo-en-medellin.mp3?Expires=1794099400&Signature=o8cmeamnyALcocbvIjVEoiiQvctrDoUjoQuSiX6CHjrgJ1gL1sB-RtTcmMNtX96QGrTYeOS~taWibjjF-AQvoatnCnTdXpqlSaILJzQo34DkjwRIC4ul2aeeO~4ksPxuH-Q4sDZ4gP4cxfNoFOlbS7yhw5n1LmKlLJUAtTu5ZkaKpZao0SDn2m5Dmc-ABGoUDMf4lQhN44G0UbpHDhOF-q3Su4VMMO5aLmYNjhWE2kZQKHcu8rBjlKGIqB8f7U5gmWjiUkCk0CCP7UX97-GK~4B95GUVh03qRjNF1n76RFgbaChRks3RbJe01~rT0lUxGgctywkEikQP44xC7NMRfA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
